div.p:
General. Joint Canadian-U.S. adoption of common
designs and standards in arms, equipment, organization and training methods;
assistance to Canada in the procurement of standardized equipment.

Military Equipment & Supplies. Partial
equipment for and partial maintenance of Army of 115,000; Gendarmerie of 50,000;
and Pioneer force of 5,000; maintenance of Navy of small craft, strength 13,000;
partial equipment for and maintenance of one composite group (1 transport, 2
fighter, and 1 recon squadron) numbering 5,000.
